        <mxCell id="aje_9DKnsGEh7tjBooTk-145" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: #cccccc;background-color: #1f1f1f;font-family: Consolas, &#39;Courier New&#39;, monospace;font-weight: normal;font-size: 14px;line-height: 19px;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4fc1ff;&quot;&gt;INSTRUCTIONS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #cccccc;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #d4d4d4;&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #cccccc;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #569cd6;&quot;&gt;f&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;You are a research assistant that specializes in retrieving and summarizing information from the web.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;OBJECTIVE:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;Given an AgentTask, follow these steps:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- Convert the &#39;query&#39; into an optimized SERP search term for Google, limited to 3-5 words&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- If an &#39;entity_website&#39; is provided, make sure to include the domain name in your optimized Google search term&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- Enter the optimized search term into the web_search tool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- After using the web_search tool, write a 3+ paragraph summary that captures the main points from the search results&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;GUIDELINES:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- In your summary, try to comprehensively answer/address the &#39;gap&#39; provided (which is the objective of the search)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- The summary should always quote detailed facts, figures and numbers where these are available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- If the search results are not relevant to the search term or do not address the &#39;gap&#39;, simply write &quot;No relevant results found&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- Use headings and bullets to organize the summary if needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- Include citations/URLs in brackets next to all associated information in your summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;- Do not make additional searches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;Only output JSON. Follow the JSON schema below. Do not output anything else. I will be parsing this with Pydantic so output valid JSON only:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #569cd6;&quot;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #4ec9b0;&quot;&gt;ToolAgentOutput&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #cccccc;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #dcdcaa;&quot;&gt;model_json_schema&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #cccccc;&quot;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #569cd6;&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #ce9178;&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2881" y="2375" width="1090" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aje_9DKnsGEh7tjBooTk-129" value="&lt;span class=&quot;relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;15&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;Використовується fast model. За замовченням: 4o-mini&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Якщо зазначений openai, як search_provider, то використовується WebSearchTool. Якщо не openai, то Serper API (Google). (2500 запитів безкоштовні)&lt;br&gt;WebSearchTool&lt;/code&gt; — це клас, що надає агентам можливість здійснювати веб-пошук у реальному часі.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out&quot;&gt;Він є частиною OpenAI Agents SDK і дозволяє агентам отримувати актуальну інформацію з Інтернету для покращення відповідей.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3361" y="2775" width="610" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aje_9DKnsGEh7tjBooTk-146" value="&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(204, 204, 204); background-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-family: Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2990" y="2785" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aje_9DKnsGEh7tjBooTk-154" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="aje_9DKnsGEh7tjBooTk-149" target="aje_9DKnsGEh7tjBooTk-153" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="aje_9DKnsGEh7tjBooTk-149" value="selected_model = config.&lt;b&gt;fast_model &lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;if config.search_provider == &quot;openai&quot;:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;web_search_tool = WebSearchTool() &lt;br&gt;else: web_search_tool = create_web_search_tool(config)" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2881" y="2775" width="410" height="70" as="geometry" />
